{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48795","headline":"秋夜巫山 · 乔备","name":"秋夜巫山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巫峡裴回雨，阳台淡荡云。\n江山空窈窕，朝暮自纷氲。\n萤色寒秋露，猨啼清夜闻。\n谁怜梦魂远，肠断思纷纷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"乔备","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48795.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48795","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}